<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
  <meta
    name="description"
    content="Fun by Arva Johnson LLC — original art, books, novelty products, game concepts and creative ideas."
  />
  <title>Fun by Arva Johnson LLC</title>

  <style>
    :root {
      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
      color: #ffffff;
      background: #050914;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at top, #12376a 0%, #07152d 40%, #030711 100%);
      min-height: 100vh;
    }

    .wrap {
      width: min(1100px, 92%);
      margin: auto;
    }

    header {
      padding: 28px 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.15);
    }

    .brand {
      font-size: 1.3rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: .04em;
    }

    .hero {
      padding: 90px 0 70px;
    }

    h1 {
      margin: 0;
      max-width: 900px;
      font-size: clamp(2.7rem, 8vw, 5.8rem);
      line-height: .98;
    }

    .tagline {
      margin-top: 25px;
      max-width: 760px;
      font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 3vw, 1.8rem);
      color: #bcd7ff;
    }

    .intro {
      max-width: 760px;
      font-size: 1.08rem;
      line-height: 1.7;
      color: #d7e3f6;
    }

    .button {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 24px;
      padding: 14px 22px;
      background: #1687ff;
      color: white;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 700;
      border-radius: 8px;
    }

    section {
      padding: 55px 0;
    }

    h2 {
      font-size: 2rem;
      margin-bottom: 25px;
    }

    .grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
      gap: 18px;
    }

    .card {
      padding: 25px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.15);
      border-radius: 14px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,.06);
    }

    .card h3 {
      margin-top: 0;
    }

    .card p {
      line-height: 1.55;
      color: #cdd9eb;
    }


    .art-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(230px, 1fr));
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .art-card {
      margin: 0;
      overflow: hidden;
      border-radius: 16px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.16);
      background: rgba(255,255,255,.05);
      box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.28);
    }

    .art-card a {
      display: block;
    }

    .art-card img {
      display: block;
      width: 100%;
      aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;
      object-fit: cover;
      transition: transform .2s ease;
    }

    .art-card:hover img {
      transform: scale(1.025);
    }

    .gallery-note {
      margin-top: -10px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
      max-width: 760px;
      color: #cdd9eb;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .spider-card {
      border-color: rgba(151,106,255,.5);
      background: linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(64,24,111,.42), rgba(14,19,45,.8));
    }

    .spiderborn {
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      border-radius: 18px;
      padding: 38px;
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 85% 20%, rgba(102,67,180,.32), transparent 35%),
        linear-gradient(135deg, #160d29, #07101f 60%, #02050c);
      border: 1px solid rgba(151,106,255,.55);
      box-shadow: inset 0 0 50px rgba(42,20,80,.35);
    }

    .spiderborn::after {
      content: "🕸️";
      position: absolute;
      right: 18px;
      top: 8px;
      font-size: clamp(5rem, 15vw, 9rem);
      opacity: .12;
      transform: rotate(8deg);
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .spider-icon {
      font-size: 2rem;
      letter-spacing: .3rem;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .spiderborn h2 {
      margin-top: 0;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 3.4rem);
    }

    .spiderborn strong {
      color: #d9c7ff;
    }

    .spotlight {
      border-radius: 18px;
      padding: 35px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #163f7a, #09172c);
      border: 1px solid rgba(95,166,255,.45);
    }

    footer {
      margin-top: 40px;
      padding: 35px 0;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.15);
      color: #aebdd1;
      font-size: .95rem;
    }

    a {
      color: inherit;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <header>
    <div class="wrap brand">FUN BY ARVA JOHNSON LLC</div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="wrap">
        <h1>Building Worlds.<br />Designing Ideas.<br />Creating Products.</h1>

        <p class="tagline">
          Original creations from art and books to novelty products,
          game concepts and ideas that refuse to stay in one box.
        </p>

        <p class="intro">
          Fun by Arva Johnson LLC is an Arkansas creative company founded
          by Leslie Eugene Johnson Jr. Our work spans original artwork,
          printed products, books, photography, novelty gifts, game concepts
          and an expanding collection of creative projects.
        </p>

        <a class="button" href="mailto:funbyarvajohnsonjohnson@gmail.com">
          Contact Fun by Arva Johnson LLC
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <div class="wrap">
        <h2>What We Create</h2>

        <div class="grid">
          <div class="card">
            <h3>Original Art & Prints</h3>
            <p>
              Original artwork ranging from bold fantasy and creature designs
              to humor, seasonal art and photography-inspired creations.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="card">
            <h3>Books</h3>
            <p>
              Original fiction and imaginative worlds spanning horror,
              fantasy, supernatural stories and larger creative universes.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="card">
            <h3>Novelty Products</h3>
            <p>
              Original gag gifts and unusual product concepts including
              Fart in a Jar, Burp in a Jar and Sneeze in a Jar.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="card">
            <h3>Game Concepts</h3>
            <p>
              New worlds, mechanics and entertainment concepts developed
              through the Stormborn Games creative branch.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="card spider-card">
            <h3>Spiderborn 🕷️</h3>
            <p>
              A web-spun extension of Stormborn creativity — eerie creature art,
              dark fantasy, horror energy and strange original ideas crawling
              out of the creative web.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="spiderborn">
          <div class="spider-icon" aria-hidden="true">🕷️ 🕸️ 🕷️</div>
          <h2>Spiderborn</h2>
          <p class="intro">
            Where Stormborn gets tangled in the web. Spiderborn brings together
            creature concepts, dark imagination, horror-inspired art and original
            designs with a strange webbed edge.
          </p>
          <p>
            <strong>Spiderborn v3.20.1 — plugged into the web.</strong>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>


